<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN SCORE 197 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN SCORE 197 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 197 all out in their limited overs World Series match against West Indies at the Gabba on Friday.</p>
<p>Score - Pakistan 197 all out in 49.5 overs (Ijaz Ahmed 59) v West Indies</p>
